---
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<section class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl 2xl:max-w-[88rem] px-5 pt-20 pb-14 text-center md:px-8 md:pt-28 md:pb-16">
  <span class="eyebrow mx-auto">长江大学 · 硕士在读 · 2024 – 2027</span>

  <p class="mt-7 text-lg font-medium text-muted md:text-xl">你好，我是</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-7xl">
    <span class="text-grad">兰永重</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-2xl">
    <span class="text-grad">AI Application Developer</span>
    <span class="text-muted"> · Python / Machine Learning</span>
  </p>

  <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl text-[15px] leading-[1.95] text-muted md:text-base">
    主要关注大模型应用、RAG / GraphRAG、知识图谱以及 Python
    与机器学习工程。具有 AI 大模型开发、数据分析、深度学习模型训练和模型部署相关经历，参与并完成过从文档解析、知识构建、模型训练到推理部署的完整技术流程。
  </p>

  <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
    <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-primary">
      查看项目
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="btn btn-secondary">联系我</a>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-9 font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-faint">
    RAG / GraphRAG · Knowledge Graph · PyTorch · ONNX Deployment
  </p>
</section>
